<h2 id="toc0"><span>The Martial</span></h2>
<p>A Martial NPC is a catch-all for combat-focused creatures with no natural access to magic, striking again and again with relentless speed. It might be a martial adventurer, a bandit, a knight, a duelist or any other skilled fighter. It has no equipment preferences: the armor and weapons it trains with are picked up at random as it gains levels. It can still gain magic through feats and magic items.</p>
<p>A NPC gains the following class features as it gains levels, as summarized on the Martial table.</p>
